{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_001_06_j",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:fdb3fe96382f9a5c6c3821ccb9243461535d52b3942b736574f6101978fd72f2",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_j:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7f9830173e98b5bea51ec0db7c6375e3ae708590c06a2285525d363e93c8274c",
      "text": "……那个，●●●●プロデューサー。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_j:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6318036999ca5f71304f42d50cf9c59be0b407bbfb2a658bcd36b73a7e484117",
      "text": "我们作为偶像、作为人，\n或许都还很不成熟……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_j:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:34cf1e95dbedc008ed36a97ae0a3cb8216c00d9992e873398e92141b8739b5f1",
      "text": "但今后要是能继续\n帮助我们成长，我会很高兴的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_j:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:792b84b06c9260771fe176d73a82869c632f3a98165f074d8c3437de874ef093",
      "text": "只要有制作人在，\n我们一定能够跨越任何艰难险阻。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_j:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3c61502ccc3cfdcd689d113cdae85437734327bfbc0318b0b5017a442a30a0d4",
      "text": "嗯，那是当然。\n今后也一起加油吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_j:cmd-000086:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_j:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:25de8bbbf449b97bdf6b5afc380d1701af5ebe5832b8ef846b86b8b0845ae798",
      "text": "真怀念啊，这封信。\n没想到真的能找出来。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_j:cmd-000104:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c8855456b5f7ecf5765bda75a907b6e14ea1f39ccf5d385cb8522bd13c7228c6",
      "text": "（……“在父母眼里，孩子永远都是孩子”吗）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_j:cmd-000110:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0bbf4a1a3eb4f1a12bac11bffeb0c3fa7c16010de9186a04bdeb6cd0fc4930fa",
      "text": "（反过来肯定也是一样的吧。\n对孩子来说，父母是无可替代的存在）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_j:cmd-000114:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0014c996530adaec15f29c3c9667fa620f855fa66e16787094b27aac31975bcf",
      "text": "（正因如此，我才会如此强烈地希望\n他们能够理解我吧……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_j:cmd-000125:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:949c14f270b62ef5c2f7aa498af1a66dccde381e34d985d28b0370e4e6e582a2",
      "text": "“明明希望你们能够更多地理解我”……嗯？\n后面的内容空白了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_j:cmd-000134:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6d9d83063eca8b9021b31e3ce442cf28509f6516395a31a6032b0f52deca9648",
      "text": "（是因为觉得反正也不会被理解，\n中途就放弃写下去了吗……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_j:cmd-000143:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2aac0f7c740fb75cd73a4185b246877fc70ac1e80a4fc8ca5f5b9ec0191db2fd",
      "text": "……好。就由现在的我来续写下去吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_j:cmd-000152:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:76d99eb3004fda106f07677db562b2d4a390e4226c5d824ea23ef64cb0251495",
      "text": "“希望你们能更多地理解我……\n不，有朝一日我一定会让你们理解的！”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_j:cmd-000158:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:00963c674d4f164e6a379d93391eebc29ee680d0c5b12887cd755aba9ebf18e0",
      "text": "“成长为足够优秀、能让你们认可的模样，\n更加茁壮地成长……”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_j:cmd-000167:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7f549a367bd50b804751589d5192a7d8f67add32d0b38120180ff6ef615eeb57",
      "text": "（……对。为了那终将到来的时刻。\n我要在这里，好好展现自己的成长给你们看）",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
